<title>USA: Comstock shareholders okay holding company.</title>
<headline>Comstock shareholders okay holding company.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nevada 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comstock Bank on Friday said its shareholders have approved the formation of a holding company whereby Comstock Bank will become a wholly owned unit of Comstock Bancorp.</p>
<p>Shareholders of record on June 15, will receive two shares of the holding company stock for each share of Comstock Bank. The new stock is payable June 16. The ticker symbol will remain LODE.</p>
</text>
